# Before/After Multiple Extensions Example
# Multiple concept extensions using both `before` and `after` in the same section.
# From Story125/Story126/Story201: CPL Concepts Parser/Analyzer - Before/After

concepts
	Priority=[Values[Low, Medium, High]]

concepts
	# Insert Critical before Low (position 0)
	Priority=[Values[Critical]] before Low

	# Insert Urgent after Medium (position after Medium)
	Priority=[Values[Urgent]] after Medium
